  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Equation of plane parallel to $x-2 y+2 z-5=0$ is $x-2 y+2 z+k=0 \\dots \\dots(1)$ \nperpendicular distance from $\\mathrm{O}(0,0,0)$ to $(1)$ is $1$\n$\\frac{|k|}{\\sqrt{1+4+4}}=1 \\quad \\Rightarrow|k|=3 \\quad \\Rightarrow k=\\pm 3 \\quad \\therefore x-2 y+2 z-3=0$",
    "image": null
  },
